<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Telecom see-saws before meeting.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Telecom see-saws before meeting.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan Telecommunication Company Ltd (PTCL) 10-rupee stock fluctuated before its board of directors meeting at Islamabad on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The stock rose 0.25 rupee to 30 in early trade before falling to 29.30 in the afternoon at the Karachi Stock Exchange a few hours before the company's board meeting at Islamabad, one dealer said.</p>
<p>Some 10 million shares changed hands in early trade.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
